# RDF 3.9.0 Release Notes

## 3.9.0

-- New Features --

[New] rdf account (add|list|link|remove|dir): run Claude Code on several accounts that
      share projects, auto memory, --resume history and config; each extra account gets
      ~/.claude-<name> holding its own login, .claude.json, plugins and org-managed
      settings, with an allowlist of shared entries symlinked to ~/.claude
[New] rdf shell init [--sandbox]: bash/zsh launchers claude, c, cs, ch and cuse; a leading
      @<name> or a sticky 'cuse <name>' picks the account and drops inherited credential
      and provider env vars; --fs maps to --fork-session; --sandbox scopes IS_SANDBOX=1 to
      cs runs; launchers survive Claude Code's Bash-tool shell snapshot

-- Changes --

[Change] docs/platform-triage.md: 3.9 block re-checked against Claude Code 2.1.308; per-call
         subagent effort noted (variants kept), multi-account row added
[Change] reference/claude-code-cache-audit.md: clarified analysis rules, data parsing and
         output format
